# Copy to `.env.local` (git-ignored) to override locally, or set these in the
# build environment of whatever host serves the built assets.
#
# Vite inlines VITE_* variables at BUILD time, not at run time. A deployed
# bundle carries whatever was set when `pnpm build` ran, so changing the API
# origin means rebuilding and redeploying the web app — not restarting it.
# Nothing secret may ever go in a VITE_* variable for the same reason: it ends
# up in JavaScript the browser downloads.

# Absolute origin of the API.
#
# Leave UNSET for local development and for the Playwright suite. Vite's dev
# server proxies /api and /health to the API on :5013 (see vite.config.ts), so
# the browser sees a single origin, and an unset value means "use the page's
# own origin", which is exactly that.
#
# Set it for a deployed build, where the SPA is served from a static host and
# the API runs elsewhere — the two are different origins and the API's CORS
# allow-list has to name this app's origin in turn.
#
# VITE_API_BASE_URL=https://pos-api.fly.dev
